DESCRIPTION:2 day fest @ Axelrad | 3 stages | 40+ local bands | Ticketed | 
	All Ages<br><a href="https://www.tixtree.com/e/solar-flare-music-festival-
	2026-fe0d7961f73e">TICKETS AND INFO HERE</a><br><br>Solar Flare Music Fest
	ival is THE event for artists and audiences in Houston. This two-day music
	 festival\, hosted by Houston Music Classifieds\, brings together some of 
	Houston's most exciting voices. This weekend is stacked with live music fr
	om 40+ local acts across three stages\, an artists market with incredible 
	vendors\, and some very special surprises after midnight.<br>Friday's musi
	c runs from 6:00 PM to midnight. Saturday kicks off at 2 PM and goes late.
	 Just good people and nonstop music in the middle of Houston. The festival
	 is all ages (anyone under 18 MUST have an adult present) and everyone und
	er 21 will be allowed  until the last band ends at Midnight.<br>Located at
	 Axelrad Beer Garden\, Solar Flare is more than a festival\, it’s a love l
	etter to the artists who make this city special.\n\nFrom Axelrad Beer Gard
	en
